: curl leaning left.","targetId":"s1a2p3z1b4o2y","targetName":"Cream","request":"A wobbling dollop with stubby feet bumps passing knights. Pose: curl leaning left."},{"id":"a1l3t1v2w5l1d","kind":"image","name":"right","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":46,"height":40,"resolution":1,"centerX":23,"centerY":20,"description":"A wobbling dollop with stubby feet bumps passing knights. Pose: curl leaning right.","targetId":"s1a2p3z1b4o2y","targetName":"Cream","request":"A wobbling dollop with stubby feet bumps passing knights. Pose: curl leaning right."},{"id":"a5048084g2832","kind":"image","name":"up","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":52,"height":38,"resolution":1,"centerX":26,"centerY":19,"description":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up.","targetId":"s0j1i4u3r6e2p","targetName":"Macaron","request":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up."},{"id":"a474e2u693r1x","kind":"image","name":"down","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":52,"height":38,"resolution":1,"centerX":26,"centerY":19,"description":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings down.","targetId":"s0j1i4u3r6e2p","targetName":"Macaron","request":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings down."},{"id":"a3e5k4i3d0x2j","kind":"image","name":"wrapped","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":46,"height":44,"resolution":1,"centerX":23,"centerY":22,"description":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked.","targetId":"s0g2y18346g40","targetName":"Bonbon","request":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked."},{"id":"a2q2b413t3i6c","kind":"image","name":"bright","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":46,"height":44,"resolution":1,"centerX":23,"centerY":22,"description":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil flared with pale highlights.","targetId":"s0g2y18346g40","targetName":"Bonbon","request":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil flared with pale highlights."},{"id":"a0j184s3i3f0d","kind":"image","name":"lit","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":36,"height":55,"resolution":1,"centerX":18,"centerY":27.5,"description":"A smiling blue birthday candle lights the next checkpoint. Pose: flame leaning left.","targetId":"s226w6k5o5923","targetName":"Candle","request":"A smiling blue birthday candle lights the next checkpoint. Pose: flame leaning left."},{"id":"a5f5e4u284w2l","kind":"image","name":"flicker","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":36,"height":55,"resolution":1,"centerX":18,"centerY":27.5,"description":"A smiling blue birthday candle lights the next checkpoint. Pose: flame leaning right.","targetId":"s226w6k5o5923","targetName":"Candle","request":"A smiling blue birthday candle lights the next checkpoint. Pose: flame leaning right."},{"id":"a5y3w10135d5g","kind":"image","name":"shut","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":112,"height":86,"resolution":1,"centerX":56,"centerY":43,"description":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: cherry hidden under visor.","targetId":"s395x1k6y0w2y","targetName":"Crown","request":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: cherry hidden under visor."},{"id":"a1w250c0w6336","kind":"image","name":"warn","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":112,"height":86,"resolution":1,"centerX":56,"centerY":43,"description":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: teeth clenched with amber highlights.","targetId":"s395x1k6y0w2y","targetName":"Crown","request":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: teeth clenched with amber highlights."},{"id":"a3w5n4v4t3p29","kind":"image","name":"open","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":112,"height":86,"resolution":1,"centerX":56,"centerY":43,"description":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: visor up revealing a red cherry.","targetId":"s395x1k6y0w2y","targetName":"Crown","request":"A giant gold fondant crown with grumpy eyes drops candy and exposes a soft cherry. Pose: visor up revealing a red cherry."},{"id":"a3s6z4h2f196e","kind":"image","name":"pink","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":30,"height":34,"resolution":1,"centerX":15,"centerY":17,"description":"A round pink candy teardrop falls from the crown in visible volleys. Pose: point up with bright sugar gleam.","targetId":"s593c5y3s1m4l","targetName":"Drop","request":"A round pink candy teardrop falls from the crown in visible volleys. Pose: point up with bright sugar gleam."},{"id":"a2i0w4b3y1w3f","kind":"image","name":"Crumb Gate","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":480,"height":360,"resolution":1,"centerX":240,"centerY":180,"description":"Golden sponge ramparts and oversized strawberry pennants sit against a soft blue clay sky.","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"Golden sponge ramparts and oversized strawberry pennants sit against a soft blue clay sky."},{"id":"a602c6h11633s","kind":"image","name":"Mint Gallery","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":480,"height":360,"resolution":1,"centerX":240,"centerY":180,"description":"Mint frosting arches, cool white cream columns, and translucent candy windows line the gallery.","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"Mint frosting arches, cool white cream columns, and translucent candy windows line the gallery."},{"id":"a5d600b54245m","kind":"image","name":"Chocolate Belfry","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":480,"height":360,"resolution":1,"centerX":240,"centerY":180,"description":"Deep cocoa brickwork and shiny fudge bells loom against a peach dusk sky.","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"Deep cocoa brickwork and shiny fudge bells loom against a peach dusk sky."},{"id":"a0w5p3e17706k","kind":"image","name":"Candle Roof","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":480,"height":360,"resolution":1,"centerX":240,"centerY":180,"description":"Rounded cake battlements and wax candles frame a violet night sky and a crescent sugar moon.","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"Rounded cake battlements and wax candles frame a violet night sky and a crescent sugar moon."},{"id":"a1m0n38010g2r","kind":"sound","name":"Gate Tune","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":10,"description":"music: adventure, bouncy pizzicato and gentle drums","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"music: adventure, bouncy pizzicato and gentle drums"},{"id":"a504j0a6k4a5t","kind":"sound","name":"Mint Tune","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":7.619047619047619,"description":"music: jazz, light brushes and cool vibraphone","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"music: jazz, light brushes and cool vibraphone"},{"id":"a435s5m3l1n67","kind":"sound","name":"Belfry Tune","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":8.275873015873016,"description":"music: march, playful low brass and woodblocks","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"music: march, playful low brass and woodblocks"},{"id":"a4s1p2e650y3b","kind":"sound","name":"Roof Tune","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":12,"description":"music: boss battle, playful bells and rolling drums","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"music: boss battle, playful bells and rolling drums"},{"id":"a4y3z193t4u67","kind":"sound","name":"Boing","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.303,"description":"short soft jelly spring","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"short soft jelly spring"},{"id":"a6r1x1y1u3x2l","kind":"sound","name":"Boost","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.369875,"description":"rising elastic whistle","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"rising elastic whistle"},{"id":"a2b110o6x603a","kind":"sound","name":"Berry Pop","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":1.0014058956916099,"description":"bright juicy pop","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"bright juicy pop"},{"id":"a0z686x214i1c","kind":"sound","name":"Bump","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.074625,"description":"muted slap of wet clay","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"muted slap of wet clay"},{"id":"a3x3m6c2a413o","kind":"sound","name":"Checkpoint","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":1.1873922902494332,"description":"jingle: three bright rising celesta notes","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"jingle: three bright rising celesta notes"},{"id":"a4u0h414c6b43","kind":"sound","name":"Rattle","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.5388125,"description":"quick candy rattle in a tin","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"quick candy rattle in a tin"},{"id":"a4f5r2i5m0t21","kind":"sound","name":"Candy Tap","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.05090625,"description":"hollow sugar-shell tick","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"hollow sugar-shell tick"},{"id":"a1z2g696n606r","kind":"sound","name":"Crack","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.54253125,"description":"crisp sugar shell snap","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"crisp sugar shell snap"},{"id":"a1h695d3o2m1f","kind":"sound","name":"Cake Party","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.52959375,"description":"jingle: triumphant party horns and bells","targetId":"t3i32716r3h34","targetName":"Stage","request":"jingle: triumphant party horns and bells"},{"id":"a233j4k5q621f","kind":"image","name":"left","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":52,"height":38,"resolution":1,"centerX":26,"centerY":19,"description":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up.. This frame: left","targetId":"s0j1i4u3r6e2p","targetName":"Macaron","request":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up.. This frame: left"},{"id":"a6e5l3e4g110z","kind":"image","name":"right","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":52,"height":38,"resolution":1,"centerX":26,"centerY":19,"description":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up.. This frame: right","targetId":"s0j1i4u3r6e2p","targetName":"Macaron","request":"A lavender macaron with little icing wings sweeps across upper layers. Pose: wings up.. This frame: right"},{"id":"a2u380n6h3o4e","kind":"image","name":"left","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":46,"height":44,"resolution":1,"centerX":23,"centerY":22,"description":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked.. This frame: left","targetId":"s0g2y18346g40","targetName":"Bonbon","request":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked.. This frame: left"},{"id":"a1y73530z011b","kind":"image","name":"right","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":46,"height":44,"resolution":1,"centerX":23,"centerY":22,"description":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked.. This frame: right","targetId":"s0g2y18346g40","targetName":"Bonbon","request":"A chunky chocolate truffle flashes its foil before darting sideways. Pose: foil tucked.. This frame: right"}],"pieces":[{"key":"f6f4d9d0ddc2e17f","kind":"game","target":"Stage","block":"game: [a knight made of jelly bounces up a castle made of cake]","code":"const g=this.game, v=g.vars, s=g.scene;\nconst names=['Crumb Gate','Mint Gallery','Chocolate Belfry','Candle Roof'];\nconst tunes=['Gate Tune','Mint Tune','Belfry Tune','Roof Tune'];\nconst foes=['Cream','Macaron','Bonbon'];\nconst j=g.find('Jelly');\nconst make=(n,x,y,props={})=>g.spawn(n,{x,y,visible:true,...props});\nconst clear=()=>{for(const a of [...g.sprites]) if(a.isClone) a.destroy();};\nconst banner=(text)=>g.ui.text('banner',text,{x:0,y:-150,size:15,color:'#fff4d2',background:'#33203e',bold:true});\nconst sound=(n,volume=.45)=>this.playSound(n,{volume});\nObject.assign(v,{mode:'intro',berries:0,best:0,act:0,hp:3,viewY:0});\ng.backdrop=names[0];\nbanner('JELLY KNIGHT • The crown stole the birthday!');\nlet skip=false;\ng.ui.button('start','Bounce into the castle',{x:0,y:6,width:228,height:44,key:'enter'},()=>{skip=true;});\nfor(let t=0;t<300&&!skip;t++){if(g.input.wasPressed('space')||g.input.wasPressed('enter')||g.input.mouse.clicked) break; if(t===135) banner('Sir Wobble wants that birthday back.'); yield;}\ng.ui.remove('start');\ng.ui.button('boost','Bounce',{x:171,y:-145,width:94,height:34},()=>{v.boost=true;});\nconst hud=()=>g.ui.text('status',v.mode==='boss'?`CROWN ${'◆'.repeat(v.hp)}${'◇'.repeat(9-v.hp)}   Berries ${v.berries}`:`${'♥'.repeat(v.hp)}${'♡'.repeat(3-v.hp)}   Berries ${v.berries}   Tier ${v.best}/11`,{x:0,y:151,size:16,bold:true,color:'#fff3dc',background:'#33203e'});\nconst pad=(x,y,moving=false)=>make('Wafer',x,y,{home:x,moving});\nfor(let act=0;act<3;act++){\n clear(); g.backdrop=names[act]; g.music(tunes[act]); v.act=act; v.viewY=0; g.camera.y=0; v.best=0; v.hp=3; v.mode='climb';\n const xs=[0,55,-15,-85,-20,55,115,48,-35,-105,-42,25];\n v.pads=[];\n for(let i=0;i<=11;i++){\n  const x=xs[i]*(act===1?-1:1), y=-132+i*100;\n  v.pads.push(pad(x,y,act===1&&i%3===2));\n  if(i>0) make('Berry',x+(i%2?30:-30),y+62);\n  if(i>0&&i%3===0) make('Candle',x-42,y+37);\n }\n j.reset(0); hud(); banner(`Act ${act+1}: ${names[act]} • ← → steer / Space boost`);\n for(let tick=0;tick<=4200;tick++){\n  if(tick===360) g.ui.hide('banner');\n  if(tick===600||tick===1620){\n   const i=Math.min(11,Math.max(2,v.best+1)); const p=v.pads[i];\n   const side=j.x>0?-1:1;\n   make(foes[act],side*181,p.y+66,{home:side*150,phase:side>0?1:4});\n   banner(tick===600?['Cream patrol!','Watch the winged macarons!','Gold flash? Truffle dash!'][act]:'Another patrol joins the party!');\n  }\n  if(tick===820||tick===1840) g.ui.hide('banner');\n  if(tick===3480) banner('The next door is open! Reach the top.');\n  if(v.best>=11&&tick%150===0){const p=v.pads[11]; if(g.count('Berry')<14) make('Berry',p.x+(tick%300===0?62:-62),p.y+100);}\n  if((tick>=3480&&v.best>=11)||tick===4200) break;\n  if(tick%10===0) hud(); yield;\n }\n v.mode='rest'; j.hide(); sound('Checkpoint');\n banner(`Layer cleared • ${v.berries} berries${v.best<11?' • Candle lift to the next floor!':''}`);\n yield* this.wait(3);\n}\nclear(); g.camera.y=0; v.viewY=0; g.backdrop=names[3]; g.music(tunes[3]);\nv.pads=[pad(0,-132),pad(-135,-132),pad(135,-132),pad(-74,-46),pad(74,-46)];\nconst crown=make('Crown',0,82); make('Candle',-180,-92);\nObject.assign(v,{mode:'boss',hp:9,open:false,hitAt:-10,phase:0,assist:false});\nj.reset(0); hud();\nconst labels=['King Crumble • Rain of Sugar','King Crumble • The Moving Cherry','King Crumble • Triple Drizzle'];\nfor(let phase=0;phase<3;phase++){\n v.phase=phase; v.assist=false; v.open=false; v.phaseFloor=6-3*phase;\n const begin=g.time;\n let cycle=-1;\n banner(labels[phase]);\n for(;;){\n  const elapsed=g.time-begin, k=Math.floor(elapsed/5.5), t=elapsed-k*5.5;\n  if(k!==cycle){cycle=k; if(v.hp>v.phaseFloor&&elapsed<30) sound('Rattle',.35);}\n  const target=phase===0?0:phase===1?Math.sin(elapsed*1.75)*96:(k%2===0?-63:63);\n  v.assist=elapsed>=30;\n  crown.x+=(Math.max(-2.8,Math.min(2.8,(v.assist?0:target)-crown.x)));\n  crown.y=v.assist?63:82;\n  v.open=v.hp>v.phaseFloor&&(v.assist||t>=3.1);\n  crown.costume=v.open?'open':t<.85&&v.hp>v.phaseFloor?'warn':'shut';\n  if(!v.assist&&v.hp>v.phaseFloor){\n   const shots=phase===0?[[.85,-130],[.85,0],[.85,130]]:phase===1?[[.85,-65],[1.35,65],[1.85,0]]:[[.85,-142],[.85,0],[.85,142],[1.65,-75],[1.65,75],[2.15,0]];\n   for(const [at,dx] of shots) if(t>=at&&t-g.dt<at){crown.shoot('Drop',{at:270,from:{x:Math.max(-190,Math.min(190,crown.x+dx)),y:crown.y-35},speed:phase===2?245:205,range:245}); sound('Candy Tap',.12);}\n  }\n  if(elapsed>=4) banner(v.assist?'Candle helper! Bounce up into the open cherry.':v.hp<=v.phaseFloor?'Shell cracked! The crown is catching its breath.':v.open?'Cherry open! Bounce into it from below.':'Candy falling • watch the lanes!');\n  hud();\n  if(v.hp<=v.phaseFloor&&elapsed>=22) break;\n  yield;\n }\n}\nv.mode='rest'; v.open=false; g.ui.remove('boost'); g.ui.remove('status');\ng.effects.burst({x:crown.x,y:crown.y,color:0xffce75,count:52,speed:175,size:6,lifetime:1.5});\ns.run;\nthis.run(function*(){yield* this.tween(crown,{size:145,opacity:0},.65,'easeOut');crown.destroy();});\nsound('Cake Party',.7);\nbanner(`Birthday saved! ${v.berries} berries on the cake.`);\nyield* this.wait(2.5); banner(v.berries>=25?'Secret title: Royal Jam Inspector!':'Sir Wobble requests one extremely small slice.');\nyield* this.wait(2.5); g.win(`Jelly Knight! Birthday saved with ${v.berries} berries.`);"},{"key":"b21eeb6b39fa70b0","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"art style: [claymation: chunky rounded shapes with soft shading and shiny highlights]","code":"const g=this.game, s=g.scene;\ng.background='#40283f';\nconst dust=[];\nfor(let i=0;i<23;i++){\n const r=2+i%3;\n const dot=s.add.ellipse((i*89)%480,(i*53)%360,r,r,0xffedda,.34).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-5);\n dust.push({dot,x:dot.x,y:dot.y,a:i*.81});\n}\nconst bands=s.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(80);\nbands.fillStyle(0x291a34,.76);bands.fillRect(0,0,480,47);bands.fillRect(0,315,480,45);\nfor(;;){\n const t=g.time;\n for(const d of dust){d.dot.x=(d.x+t*(4+d.a%6))%480;d.dot.y=(d.y+360+9*Math.sin(t*.8+d.a))%360;d.dot.alpha=.17+.18*(1+Math.sin(t*1.2+d.a));}\n yield;\n}"}],"brief":"game: [a knight made of jelly bounces up a castle made of cake]\nimagination: [grand ▾]\nart style: [claymation: chunky rounded shapes with soft shading and shiny highlights]","style":"art style: [claymation: chunky rounded shapes with soft shading and shiny highlights]","revised":[],"questions":[],"issues":[]},"dial":4}